EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Do you know how to get there?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}If you forget your way,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} just take a
look at the map, all right?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Te conoces bien el camino?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Si no lo tienes demasiado claro,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} 
échale un vistazo al mapa, ¿vale?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Te recuerdas la strada, giusto?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Se non sai da che parte andare,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
dai un'occhiata alla mappa.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Hast du den Weg vergessen?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Du kannst ja einfach auf die Karte
gucken.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Oraya nasıl gidileceğini biliyor musun?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Yolu unutursan{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} haritaya bir göz
at, olur mu?

{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Varmadan önce{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} senden bir ricam var:{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}odamın dekorunu fazla
kıskanma, tamam mı?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Siempre me pongo un pelín nervioso
la primera vez que invito a alguien a
mi casa{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Me siento siempre un poquito
nervoso quando qualcuno viene
a casa mia por la primera vez{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ora che ci penso, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
questa è la primera vez che ti
mostro la mia stanza, verdad?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}This isn't your first visit, right?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I wonder if you remember how to
get there without getting lost.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Dato che sei già venut{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} a casa mia,{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}sono proprio curioso di vedere
si te recuerdas come arrivarci.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¿Eh? {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Oye, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿tienes
pensado marcharte de viaje?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Si es así,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} puedes pasarte por mi
casa en cualquier otra ocasión.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} 
Dime, ¿qué quieres hacer?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
¡Vamos a tu casa!
Mejor otro día

{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Genial, eso es lo que quería oír!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Venga, pongámonos en marcha,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}È un bel po' che camminiamo {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}y
todavía non siamo ancora arrivati.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Non ti sarai mica pers{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}?
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}La prossima volta{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} impara
il percorso, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Ti saluto, hasta la vista.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}I said, WAIT!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Bah, I'm disappointed with your
attitude, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Can't you
just be more understanding?{{TAG:000B:0003:03CD}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}J'ai dit « ATTENDS », {{TAG:0005:0008:}} !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Bah, si tu veux pas qu'on y aille
ensemble, t'avais qu'à me le dire
plus tôt, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:000B:0003:03CD}}

TRANSLATION:
